  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="06d05fa2-426a-588b-9909-e4ab4d12958a" activityNameId="c5903ebc-e360-59bb-94b6-7b2090d77a6a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Phosphate rock, as P2O5, beneficiated, wet, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Phosphate rock, as P2O5, beneficiated, wet, at plant
Large uncertainties exist for data on particle emissions from transfer and storage. Also data of emissions to water and soil are uncertain due to missing data of uncontrolled run off which was estimated.  Energy consumption data related to mass of rock moved. ;
CAS number: 065996-94-3; 
Formula: P2O5; 
UUID: 78eb7f3d-da83-32ef-a4cd-b82c6984f129
Mining process, transport to beneficiation plant, wet processing including screening, washing and flotation. No drying of calcination included. Land use for mining and reclamation.
Location: Assumption for production in U.S. based mainly on data from Florida. Various processes with location RER used.
Technology: U.S. technology for wet rock processing. No specific age of technology modelled
Time period: Time of literature publication. Measurements took place partly before this period.
Production volume: 11.2 Mt as P2O5 in 2000, 38.6 Mt as Rock in 2000
Sampling: Data for emissions and land use based on various studies from Florida. Energy data based on a world-wide survey and some assumptions. Further data from literature and estimations. 
Extrapolations: Extrapolation from 1 producer having 15% market share for emission data. Therefore representativeness set to 15%. No extrapolation for energy and land use data. Representativeness of those data is much higher, estimated to be about by 80%.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_78eb7f3d-da83-32ef-a4cd-b82c6984f129.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="9aaa4753-f7ef-5e0d-bcb0-bc5f01164c5b" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
